# `cmd.exe` resolves `call :label` by seeking on byte offsets. With
# LF-only line endings the seek lands mid-line and the lookup fails —
# sporadically, so most calls work and one does not. Measured on the
# user's machine: `The system cannot find the batch label specified - say`
# from a build that otherwise succeeded (context.md §3.70).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.nsi text eol=crlf
